      "derivation": "Local: high_byte=0x1A=26, low_byte=0x80, low_nibble=0x80>>4=8, raw=((26<<4)+8)=424, temp_milli=424*625/10=26500. Remote: high_byte=0x1E=30, low_byte=0x40, low_nibble=0x40>>4=4, raw=((30<<4)+4)=484, temp_milli=484*625/10=30250."
    },
